{"unit_id": "tag:01KD:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。我们称<MATH_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>满足赋值判据的存在性部分（satisfies the existence part of the valuative criterion）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果对任意给定的交换（commutative）实线图（diagram）\n<MATH_0003>\n其中<MATH_0004>为赋值（valuation）环（ring），其分式（fractions）域（field）为<MATH_0005>，相应的虚线箭头（dotted arrow）都存在。我们称<MATH_0006> <TEXTITOPEN_0002>满足赋值判据的唯一性部分（satisfies the uniqueness part of the valuative criterion）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果对任意给定的上述图（diagram），虚线箭头（dotted arrow）至多有一个（当然不要求其存在）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "satisfies the existence part of the valuative criterion", "target_term": "满足赋值判据的存在性部分"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "fractions", "target_term": "分式"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "dotted arrow", "target_term": "虚线箭头"}, {"source_term": "satisfies the uniqueness part of the valuative criterion", "target_term": "满足赋值判据的唯一性部分"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "dotted arrow", "target_term": "虚线箭头"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源与靶所属的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "概形之间的态射"}, {"source_term": "satisfies the existence part of the valuative criterion", "target_term": "满足赋值判据的存在性部分", "context": "以虚线箭头的存在性表述的条件"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换", "context": "实线图满足的交换条件"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "由给定实线箭头组成的图"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值", "context": "限定环的类型"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "赋值环中的环"}, {"source_term": "fractions", "target_term": "分式", "context