{"unit_id": "tag:01KA:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>赋值（valuation）环（ring）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一个在其分式域（fraction field）内关于支配（domination）关系（relation）极大的局部整环（local domain），见代数（Algebra）一章的定义<REF_0001>。因此，赋值（valuation）环（ring）的谱（spectrum）有唯一的泛点（generic point）<MATH_0001>和唯一的闭点（closed point）<MATH_0002>，当然还有特化（specialization）<MATH_0003>。赋值（valuation）环（rings）的意义在于，任意概形（scheme）中点的任意特化（specialization）都是<MATH_0004>在某个从某赋值（valuation）环（ring）的谱（spectrum）出发的态射（morphism）下的像（image）。精确的结果如下。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "fraction field", "target_term": "分式域"}, {"source_term": "domination", "target_term": "支配"}, {"source_term": "relation", "target_term": "关系"}, {"source_term": "local domain", "target_term": "局部整环"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值", "context": "限定环的类型"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "赋值环中的环"}, {"source_term": "fraction field", "target_term": "分式域", "context": "局部整环所在的域"}, {"source_term": "domination", "target_term": "支配", "context": "局部环之间的支配"}, {"source_term": "relation", "target_term": "关系", "context": "给出极大性的支配关系"}, {"source_term": "local domain", "target_term": "局部整环", "context": "赋值环所属的环类"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引章节的名称"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值", "context": "限定环的类型"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "赋值环中的环"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "赋值环的素谱"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "该谱的唯一泛点"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "该谱的唯一闭点"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特化", "context": "该谱中两点间的特化"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值", "context": "限定环的类型"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "用来实现特化的环"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "进行点的特化的空间"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特化", "context": "任意概形中点的特化"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值", "context": "限定环的类型"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "赋值环中的环"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "给定态射的源概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "从赋值环的谱出发的态射"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "给定特化在态射下的像"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01J8:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>中点（points）的一个特化（specialization）。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 存在一个赋值（valuation）环（ring）<MATH_0004>和一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>，使得泛点（generic point）<MATH_0006>（属于<MATH_0007>）映到（maps）<MATH_0008>，而特殊点（special point）映到（maps）<MATH_0009>，并且\n<STRUCT_0003> 给定一个域（field）扩张（extension）<MATH_0010>，我们可以使扩张（extension）<MATH_0011>（由<MATH_0012>诱导）与所给扩张（extension）同构（isomorphic）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映到"}, {"source_term": "special point", "target_term": "特殊点"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映到"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中给定的空间"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "发生特化的对象"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特化", "context": "概形中点的特化"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值", "context": "限定环的类型"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "其谱实现给定的特化"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "实现给定特化的态射"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "赋值环的谱的泛点"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映到", "context": "叙述泛点的像"}, {"source_term": "special point", "target_term": "特殊点", "context": "与泛点相对的点"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映到", "context": "叙述特殊点的像"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "所给扩张涉及的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "预先给定的域扩张"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "由态射诱导的域扩张"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "用来指定同构类型的扩张"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "两个扩张之间的同构关系"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01J8:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>中的一个特化（specialization），并设<MATH_0003>为一个域（fields）扩张（extension）。由引理<REF_0001>及引理<REF_0002>之后的讨论，由此得到环同态（ring maps）<MATH_0004>。\n设<MATH_0005>为任意一个赋值（valuation）环（ring），其分式（fractions）域（field）为<MATH_0006>，并且它支配（dominates）<MATH_0007>的像（image），见代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0003>。\n环同态（ring map）<MATH_0008>诱导态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>，见引理<REF_0004>。由构造知，此态射（morphism）具有所需的全部性质。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "fractions", "target_term": "分式"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "dominates", "target_term": "支配"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特化", "context": "给定概形中的点的特化"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域", "context": "发生扩张的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "所给的域扩张"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "从特化和域扩张得到的同态"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值", "context": "限定环的类型"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "满足所列分式域和支配条件的环"}, {"source_term": "fractions", "target_term": "分式", "context": "分式域中的分式"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "所选赋值环的分式域"}, {"source_term": "dominates", "target_term": "支配", "context": "赋值环与给定像之间的支配关系"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "受赋值环支配的像"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引章节的名称"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "诱导所需态射的环同态"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由环同态诱导的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "满足引理全部要求的态射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01KE:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。以下条件等价（equivalent）\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 特化（Specializations）可沿<MATH_0002>的任意基变换（base change）提升（lift）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>满足赋值判据的存在性部分（satisfies the existence part of the valuative criterion）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "Specializations", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "satisfies the existence part of the valuative criterion", "target_term": "满足赋值判据的存在性部分"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源与靶所属的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中给定的概形态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "两个条件互相蕴涵"}, {"source_term": "Specializations", "target_term": "特化", "context": "需要提升的点的特化"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "对给定态射作的任意基变换"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升", "context": "沿态射提升特化"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "要检验赋值判据的态射"}, {"source_term": "satisfies the existence part of the valuative criterion", "target_term": "满足赋值判据的存在性部分", "context": "与特化的提升等价的条件"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01KE:proof", "translation": "假设（1）成立。给定一个如定义<REF_0001>所述的实线图（diagram）。为找到虚线箭头（dotted arrow），我们可以把<MATH_0001>换成<MATH_0002>，因为这一假设在基变换（base change）下保持成立。于是可以假设<MATH_0003>。\n设<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>的像（image），于是有<MATH_0006>，见引理<REF_0002>。由假设，存在一个特化（specialization）<MATH_0007>，位于<MATH_0008>中，使得<MATH_0009>映到（maps）<MATH_0010>的闭点（closed point）。我们得到一个局部环（local ring）同态（map）<MATH_0011>和一个环同态（ring map）<MATH_0012>，见引理<REF_0003>及引理<REF_0004>之后的讨论。它们的复合（composition）<MATH_0013>是给定的单射（injection）<MATH_0014>。由于<MATH_0015>是局部的（local），<MATH_0016>的像（image）支配（dominates）<MATH_0017>，因此等于<MATH_0018>，见代数（Algebra）一章的定义<REF_0005>。于是得到一个环同态（ring map）<MATH_0019>，进而得到一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0020>（见引理<REF_0006>及其后的讨论）。这证明了（2）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n反过来，假设（2）成立。赋值判据的存在性部分（existence part of the valuative criterion）对任意基变换（base change）<MATH_0021>（由<MATH_0022>作基变换而得）均成立，只需考虑以下交换图（commutative diagram）即可看出。\n<MATH_0023>\n具体而言，由纤维积（fibre product）的定义，较为水平（horizontal）的那条虚线箭头（dotted arrow）给出另一条。于是显然只需证明特化（specializations）可沿<MATH_0024>提升（lift）。\n设<MATH_0025>为<MATH_0026>中的一个特化（specialization），并设<MATH_0027>为位于<MATH_0028>上方的一个点（point）。将引理<REF_0007>应用于<MATH_0029>和域（fields）扩张（extension）<MATH_0030>，得到一个交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0031>\n再由条件（2）得到虚线箭头（dotted arrow）。像（image）<MATH_0032>，即<MATH_0033>的闭点（closed point）在<MATH_0034>中的像，便是所求。也就是说，<MATH_0035>是<MATH_0036>的一个特化（specialization），并映到（maps）<MATH_0037>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "dotted arrow", "target_term": "虚线箭头"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映到"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_ter