{"unit_id": "tag:01KF:statement", "translation": "泛闭性（universal closedness）的赋值判据（Valuative criterion）<OWNARGEND_0001>设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphism）。则<MATH_0002>是泛闭的（universally closed），当且仅当<MATH_0003>满足赋值判据的存在性部分（satisfies the existence part of the valuative criterion）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universal closedness", "target_term": "泛闭性"}, {"source_term": "Valuative criterion", "target_term": "赋值判据"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "泛闭的"}, {"source_term": "satisfies the existence part of the valuative criterion", "target_term": "满足赋值判据的存在性部分"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "universal closedness", "target_term": "泛闭性", "context": "命题所刻画的性质"}, {"source_term": "Valuative criterion", "target_term": "赋值判据", "context": "用于刻画泛闭性的判据"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源与靶所属的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "给定态射满足的紧性条件"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "要判定泛闭性的态射"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "泛闭的", "context": "命题所刻画的性质"}, {"source_term": "satisfies the existence part of the valuative criterion", "target_term": "满足赋值判据的存在性部分", "context": "与泛闭性等价的存在性条件"}], "notes": []}
