{"unit_id": "tag:01KG:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个域（field）。考虑射影（projective）直线（line）的结构态射（structure morphism）<MATH_0002>，该直线以<MATH_0003>为基，见例<REF_0001>。我们用上面的赋值判据（valuative criterion）证明<MATH_0004>是泛闭的（universally closed）。\n由构造，<MATH_0005>被两个仿射开子集（affine opens）覆盖，因而<MATH_0006>是拟紧的（quasi-compact）。给定一个交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0007>\n其中<MATH_0008>是赋值（valuation）环（ring），<MATH_0009>是它的分式（fractions）域（field）。回顾<MATH_0010>是将<MATH_0011>与<MATH_0012>粘合（glueing）而得的，具体是经由<MATH_0013>与<MATH_0014>之间的<MATH_0015>进行粘合（glueing）（或更对称地，经由<MATH_0016>）。\n为证明存在可沿对角方向填入上面图（diagram）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0017>，由对称性可假设<MATH_0018>映入（maps）开子集（open）<MATH_0019>。这给出如下环（rings）的交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0020>\n由代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0002>可知，<MATH_0021>或<MATH_0022>成立。\n在第一种情形下，得到一个环同态（ring map）<MATH_0023>，可填入上面的环（rings）的图（diagram），所求即得。\n在第二种情形下，得到一个环同态（ring map）<MATH_0024>。这给出一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0025>，可沿对角方向填入本例最初的交换图（commutative diagram）（验证略）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "line", "target_term": "直线"}, {"source_term": "structure morphism", "target_term": "结构态射"}, {"source_term": "valuative criterion", "target_term": "赋值判据"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "泛闭的"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "fractions", "target_term": "分式"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映入"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "射影直线的基域"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "限定直线的类型"}, {"source_term": "line", "target_term": "直线", "context": "给出结构态射的射影直线"}, {"source_term": "structure morphism", "target_term": "结构态射", "context": "射影直线的结构态射"}, {"source_term": "valuative criterion", "target_term": "赋值判据", "context": "用来证明泛闭性的判据"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "泛闭的", "context": "本例要证明的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开子集", "context": "覆盖射影直线的开子集"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的", "context": "由有限仿射开覆盖得到的性质"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "检验赋值判据的图"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值", "context": "限定环的类型"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "给定交换图中的赋值环"}, {"source_term": "fractions", "target_term": "分式", "context": "分式域中的分式"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "该赋值环的分式域"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "构造射影直线的粘合"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "借助指定识别进行的粘合"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "需要填入态射的图"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "需要构造的对角箭头"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映入", "context": "指定像所落入的开子集"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "包含指定像的开子集"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "交换图中的对象"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "将原图转成环的图所得"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引章节的名称"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "第一种情形构造的同态"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "该图的对象"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "由环及同态构成的图"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "第二种情形构造的同态"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由该环同态给出的对角箭头"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "最初用来检验判据的图"}], "notes": []}
