{"unit_id": "tag:01KH:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0001>是豪斯多夫的（Hausdorff），当且仅当其对角线（diagonal）<MATH_0002>是闭子集（closed subset）。\n在代数几何（algebraic geometry）中，类似的做法是给定一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>，它位于基概形（base scheme）<MATH_0004>之上，然后考虑对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0005>\n这是使得<MATH_0006>和<MATH_0007>成立的唯一概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）（它在任何具有纤维积（fibre products）的范畴（category）中都存在）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "Hausdorff", "target_term": "豪斯多夫的"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角线"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "algebraic geometry", "target_term": "代数几何"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "base scheme", "target_term": "基概形"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "讨论豪斯多夫性质的空间"}, {"source_term": "Hausdorff", "target_term": "豪斯多夫的", "context": "由对角线闭性刻画的分离性质"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角线", "context": "拓扑空间平方中的对角线"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "刻画豪斯多夫性质的对角线条件"}, {"source_term": "algebraic geometry", "target_term": "代数几何", "context": "作类比的数学领域"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "基概形上的概形"}, {"source_term": "base scheme", "target_term": "基概形", "context": "给定概形所依赖的基"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角", "context": "限定此态射的类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "概形到相对平方的对角态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源与靶所属的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_