{"unit_id": "tag:01KI:statement", "translation": "仿射概形（affines）之间的态射（morphism）所对应的对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）是闭的（closed）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "态射两端的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定的概形态射"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角", "context": "限定态射的类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理断言为闭的态射"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的", "context": "对角态射满足的闭性"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01KI:proof", "translation": "与态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>相伴的对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）是环同态（ring map）<MATH_0002>，<MATH_0003>在谱（spectra）上对应的态射（morphism）。\n这个同态（map）显然是满射（surjective），所以有<MATH_0004>，其中<MATH_0005>是某个理想（ideal）。因此，<MATH_0006>是闭浸入（closed immersion），见例<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定的仿射概形间态射"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角", "context": "限定态射的类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "该态射的对角态射"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "在谱上给出态射的同态"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱", "context": "环同态所诱导的态射两端的谱"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由环同态在谱上诱导的态射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "同态", "context": "上述环同态"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "所用的环同态性质"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "用于表示商环的理想"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "所断言的对角态射性质"}], "notes": []}
