{"unit_id": "tag:01KJ:proof", "translation": "回顾一下，若<MATH_0001>是仿射开子集（affine open）并映入（maps）仿射开子集（affine open）<MATH_0002>，则<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>中的仿射开子集（affine open），见引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>。\n考虑开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0005>，它是<MATH_0006>中这些仿射开子集（affine opens）<MATH_0007>的并（union）。\n由引理<REF_0003>，只需证明每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>都是闭浸入（closed immersion）。由于<MATH_0009>，我们只须验证<MATH_0010>是闭浸入（closed immersion），这正是引理<REF_0004>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映入"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开子集", "context": "所取的源中的开子集"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映入", "context": "指定像落入靶中的开子集"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开子集", "context": "包含指定像的开子集"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开子集", "context": "由所给两个仿射开子集得到的开子集"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "给定概形中仿射开子集的并"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开子集", "context": "取并的仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并", "context": "构成该开子概形的并"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "限制到各开子集的态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "每个限制态射须满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "由后引引理给出的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01KK:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 我们称<MATH_0002>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>分离的（separated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>是闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 我们称<MATH_0004>是<TEXTITOPEN_0002>拟分离的（quasi-separated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>是拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 我们称概形（scheme）<MATH_0006>是<TEXTITOPEN_0003>分离的（separated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，如果态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>是分离的（separated）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 我们称概形（scheme）<MATH_0008>是<TEXTITOPEN_0004>拟分离的（quasi-separated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>，如果态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>是拟分离的（quasi-separated）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源与靶所属的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "要定义分离性的概形态射"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的", "context": "由对角态射为闭浸入定义的性质"}, {"source_te